# WebUni Design Implementation Plan

This plan outlines the steps to redesign the public-facing pages of the application to match the "WebUni" template style provided in the screenshots. Use common "WebUni" template aesthetics (Clean, Red/White/Dark theme, Top Navigation).

## User Review Required
- **Navigation Structure**: The current app uses a Sidebar. I propose using a Top Header for the public pages (Home, Courses, Blog, Contact) and keeping the Sidebar for the Dashboard/App pages.
- **Assets**: I will use placeholders for images. The user might need to provide specific logos or banner images later.

## Proposed Changes

### Global & Layout
#### [MODIFY] [globals.css](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/app/globals.css)
- Ensure all template utility classes (e.g., `.spad`, `.site-btn`, `.section-title`) are present.
- Add specific styles for the Header and Footer.

#### [NEW] [Header.tsx](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/components/Header.tsx)
- Implementation of the top navigation bar.
- Links: Home, Courses, Blog, Contact.
- Action: Login/Register buttons.

#### [NEW] [Footer.tsx](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/components/Footer.tsx)
- 4-column layout: About, Useful Links, Recent Posts/newsletter, Contact Info.

#### [MODIFY] [LayoutWrapper.tsx](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/components/LayoutWrapper.tsx)
- Logic update: Show `Header` and `Footer` for public routes (`/`, `/courses`, `/contact`, `/blog`).
- Keep `Sidebar` for other routes.

### Pages

#### [MODIFY] [Home Page](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/app/page.tsx)
- **Hero Section**: Background image, "Get The Best Free Online Courses", Search Bar (Name/Category).
- **Categories**: 4 column grid of course categories.
- **Featured Courses**: Carousel or Grid of top courses.
- **Join Community**: Call to action section.

#### [NEW] [Courses Page](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/app/courses/page.tsx)
- **Banner**: "Courses" title with breadcrumb.
- **Search/Filter**: Search bar and category filter.
- **Grid**: Course cards (Image, Title, Instructor, Students count, Rating, Price/Free).

#### [NEW] [Contact Page](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/app/contact/page.tsx)
- **Banner**: "Contact" title.
- **Map Section**: Visual placeholder for Google Map.
- **Split Layout**: Contact Form (Left) & Contact Info (Right - Address, Phone, Email).

#### [NEW] [Blog Page](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/app/blog/page.tsx)
- **Banner**: "Blog" or "News" title.
- **Main Layout**:
    - **Left**: Blog Posts List (Image, Title, Meta, Excerpt, Read More).
    - **Right**: Sidebar (Search, Categories, Recent Posts, Tags).

### Components

#### [NEW] [PageBanner.tsx](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/components/PageBanner.tsx)
- Reusable component for the top banner on Courses, Contact, and Blog pages.
- Props: Title, Breadcrumb image.

#### [NEW] [CourseCard.tsx](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/components/CourseCard.tsx)
- Reusable card for listing courses.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Build verification: `npm run build`.

### Manual Verification
- Navigate to `/` and check the landing page layout.
- Click "Courses" in header -> Verify `/courses`.
- Click "Contact" in header -> Verify `/contact`.
- Click "Blog" in header -> Verify `/blog`.
- Verify Dashboard (`/dashboard`) still loads with Sidebar (no Header/Footer).
